WEBVTT

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.710
I was just thinking...
Do you remember that day?
The day that we met?

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:02.040
Poem 12: Nanako and Eiji

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.710
Crap, I'm lost...

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.130
Pretty sure it should be 
around here somewhere...

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.420
It's funny...

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.830
I never would've even considered doing
something like this six months ago...

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.580
I'm sick and tired of fighting all the time!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.700
I'd trade in my fists

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.350
If it meant livin' a life

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.570
Of laughter and smiles!

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:30.130
Man, it had such a satisfying rhythm...

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:33.080
Who would've guessed that was a senryu?

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:36.000
SENRYU
POETRY
WORKSHOP

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.170
And now I'm totally hooked...

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:40.540
This must be it.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:48.000
256th Senryu Poetry Workshop
Theme: "Christmas"

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.000
Sounds like we have a latecomer.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.920
H-hello! The name's Busujima!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.830
I'm excited to be here! 
I-it's nice to meet you!

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.170
C-come in...

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.540
We're just about to wrap up, 
but sit wherever you like...

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.500
Nice.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.080
I feel like I blend right in.

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:08.920
Let's see... Up next...

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.960
With her third poem for the evening,
Nanako Yukishiro-san.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:19.710
Her uniform... She's from 
that one middle school...

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.790
Merry Christmas!

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.560
I love my dad, but...

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:24.970
His Christmas costume was, well...

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:26.200
It wasn't the best.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.960
Not what I was expecting, yet oddly charming.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.210
Seems about right for someone her age.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.580
My first senryu in the wild...

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:40.380
Would you care to elaborate
on your poem, Yukishiro-san?

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.670
Nothing to add?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.290
If that's the case, you can 
go ahead and take a seat.

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:53.790
Now that we've all shared, let's call it a-

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.130
Uh, I was just kidding!

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.130
The thug-

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.080
I mean, we haven't heard 
from you yet, young man!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.670
Our theme for today is "Christmas"...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.880
Gotcha!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.500
All done!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:13.830
Dear Mr. Santa,

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.020
Can you convince my old man

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.380
Not to smoke in bed?

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.960
Huh? She's clapping for that...?

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.670
What a strange girl...

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.380
Well then, our next meeting will be
in the new year. Have a great holiday!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:44.790
Goodbye!

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.130
Hey! Wait a sec!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:52.830
Earlier at the workshop...
You clapped for my poem, didn't you?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.040
That made me really happy. Thanks a lot!

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.250
Well, see ya!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.380
Huh? Um, listen...

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:07.040
People might start lookin' at you funny
if you hang around me too much.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.630
If we ever run into each other again,
teach me how to write some cool senryu, 'kay?

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.720
And if using 5-7-5 is how you're 
most comfortable communicating,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.130
that doesn't bother me none.

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:22.330
I was just thinking...

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.800
Do you remember that day?

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.030
The day that we met?

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.670
Did I really say somethin' like that...?

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.000
Sis?

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.330
YUKISHIRO

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.000
Hey, Sis!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.710
Hurry up and eat your breakfast!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:42.170
Did you stay up late studying 
for your entrance exams?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.290
You need a nutritious meal
if you want to keep your mind sharp!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.960
Look! Look at the yummy wiener, Nanako!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.630
You better snap out of it, or 
I'll have to eat it myself!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:57.000
N-Nanako, you... You don't like wieners?

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.960
Or do you just secretly 
hate me? Tell me the truth.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.250
You're going to be late for work, Dear.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.380
Thanks for breakfast.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.880
Still thinking about the boy
you met at the poetry workshop?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.670
Wow, how did you know?

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:16.060
I didn't say anything...

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:17.040
Is it obvious?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.920
It's pretty much written all over your face.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.580
I don't know why, but...

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:22.880
I keep thinking about him.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.160
I just can't help it...

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.790
You've got it bad.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:30.260
That workshop was just supposed
to give you a break from studying...

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:34.580
I'm guessing you forgot 
to ask for his number?

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:39.250
Then you'll just have to go
to the next meeting, won't you?

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.670
You might end up running into him again.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.420
In the meantime, try to 
focus on studying, okay?

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.330
Go on, eat your breakfast.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.500
The dim-witted young man, yes?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.180
I've seen him around a few times since then,

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:05.070
but he hasn't shown up 
to the poetry workshop.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.120
Though he has been writing senryu

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.760
and leaving them on the 
bulletin board over there.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.290
Karai News Bulletin
Senryu
Corner

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:15.460
I think he may be worried about
scaring other people away.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:24.080
I got exams soon,
But I plan on comin' back
And readin' some stuff
-Eiji

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.130
We have plenty of tanzaku inside.
You're welcome to borrow-

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:31.540
Oh my, aren't you prepared!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.000
Goodness, two poems!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.150
I'll come back again.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:41.490
I'll write to him every day

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:42.630
Until my exams!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.540
Of course. Drop by whenever you like.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.750
I hope he reads your reply.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:52.920
What? Sis, it's snowing! 
You're going out now?!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.430
Hello! How are you?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.230
I really like your poems.

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:58.500
They're so creative!

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.520
Reading them is fun.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.340
In a way, it makes me feel

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:03.480
Like we're connected!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:08.210
Thanks for sayin' so!
I dunno who you are, but...
That makes me happy!
-Eiji

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.880
So you were saying

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.380
You have your exams soon, right?

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:17.520
I'm in the same boat!

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:22.080
Whoa, for real?! No way!
Guess we both gotta work hard...
I bet we'll do great!
-Eiji

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.850
Today during class,

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.390
My stomach growled super loud...

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.710
So embarrassing!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:30.830
It's hard to study...
My old man and my rabbit
Keep distractin' me...
-Eiji

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:32.710
Eiji-kun...

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:42.000
February

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.850
So listen, Ei-chan...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.480
You've seen the cherry blossoms

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.670
At Nishi Park, right?

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.490
They haven't bloomed yet,

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.170
But now that it's almost spring,

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.600
I'm sure they will soon...

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:48.450
What if we met up

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.070
And practiced our senryu

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.420
At the park sometime?

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:56.380
Sure, sounds good to me!
Just lemme know when they bloom
And we'll meet up then!
-Eiji

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.630
March

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.910
Hey! Guess what, Ei-chan!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:03.230
Remember what we promised

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.380
Like a month ago?

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.990
The cherry blossoms

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.430
Finally bloomed at the park!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.620
Now we can meet up!

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:23.360
Oh, Ms. Senryu Girl! If you're 
looking for your thug friend,

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.810
I don't think he's coming.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:30.630
I believe he mentioned something yesterday
about not being able to drop by anymore...

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.290
Perhaps he had to move away unexpectedly...

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.790
Be careful, my dear!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:50.920
Not a clue. I doubt a hooligan like
that would be interested in senryu, anyway.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:57.790
I haven't seen him. Besides, 
this is a shogi hall.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.960
SHOGI

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.170
What's a "senryu"?

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.010
No, it can't be true!

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.420
Why would he just stop coming?!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.710
Why?! I don't get it!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.800
Please, please don't tell me...!

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.150
Did he really move away?!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:11.900
He couldn't-

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.680
This can't be the end!

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.240
There's still so much more that I

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.410
Want to say to him!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.250
I have to see him...

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.500
It has to be in person!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:24.710
I have to tell him!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.790
If it weren't for him...

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.250
If it weren't for what he said

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.210
That one time, then I...

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.880
I'd still be alone...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.230
I would be all by myself,

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.260
Locked up in my room!

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.380
I have to thank him!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.770
I have to make sure he knows!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:38.970
So he can't just leave!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.040
His voice, his warmth, all of it...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.170
More than anyone...

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.600
I want him right here...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.490
By my side, right next to me...

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:48.800
I can't let him go!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:59.880
Hm... This color's kinda hard to describe...

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:04.790
Ei-chan...!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.000
Alright, I got it!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.760
Like a hippo's sweat,

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.350
The cherry blossoms are a

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.810
Bright, pink-ish color!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.040
It's perfect!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.910
I feel like coming right 
out and comparing 'em to

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:20.250
a hippo really captures their beauty!

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.250
Whoa, where'd you come from?! You scared me!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.470
Hello! How are you?

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:30.980
I really like your poems.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.250
They're so creative!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:36.710
You think so?! Thanks a lot!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.000
I'm actually pretty proud of this one.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.960
Writing senryu is my hobby.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.670
I even got a pen pal who I 
write senryu to every day!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.290
Speakin' of, I'm supposed 
to meet 'em here soon...

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.370
Huh?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:55.500
Hello! How are you?
I really like your poems.
They're so creative!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.580
Your senryu looks kinda familiar...

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:18.670
Waracchau kurai mattaku chigau watashitachi
It's almost funny how different we are

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:23.960
Show window utsuru sugata sae
Down to our reflections in the shop window

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:29.580
Taiyou mitai ni anata ga hohoemu to
When you smile as brightly as the sun

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:38.250
Odayaka na kuuki ga nagareru
A peaceful feeling washes over me

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:45.290
Arikitari na nichijou de sae mo
Even my trivial, everyday life

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:50.880
Anata to nara kagayakidasu
Begins to shine when I'm with you

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:54.290
Tatoe nani ga okita toshitemo
Even if something happened

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.460
Tamani kizutsuki kizutsuketemo
Even if we hurt each other sometimes

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:04.540
Nanigenai hi o shinjiteite
Believe in our ordinary days
